        <mxCell id="sg" value="&lt;b&gt;Security groups&lt;/b&gt; — chained by reference, never by CIDR&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;sg-alb&lt;/b&gt; ← TCP 443 from the CloudFront prefix list&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;sg-alb&lt;/b&gt; ← TCP 80 from the same prefix list (redirect only)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;sg-web&lt;/b&gt; ← TCP 80 from sg-alb&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;sg-rds&lt;/b&gt; ← TCP 3306 from sg-web&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;No port 22 rule anywhere in the VPC.&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=6;fontSize=14;strokeColor=#8A94A6;fillColor=#F7F8FA;fontColor=#16191F;strokeWidth=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
